stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RouteQuery
    
    RouteQuery --> RetrieveEvidence: Heuristic or LLM router decides strategy
    RetrieveEvidence --> SufficiencyCheck: Evaluate evidence coverage score
    
    SufficiencyCheck --> ReQuery: Coverage < 0.30 (Attempts < 2)
    ReQuery --> RetrieveEvidence: Query expansion with HyDE
    
    SufficiencyCheck --> StreamAnswer: Coverage >= 0.30
    StreamAnswer --> VerifyCitations: Grounding check on emitted [S#] tags
    
    VerifyCitations --> CalibrateConfidence: Brier calibration across 10 bins
    CalibrateConfidence --> EmitFinalState: Attach citations, trace, and score
    
    EmitFinalState --> [*]
